      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What you are describing sounds like a profound sense of inauthenticity and exhaustion, which is incredibly heavy to carry. Feeling like you are always \"performing\" suggests a deep disconnect between your true self and the way you feel you need to show up to the world. Please remember that your internal experience is valid, even if it doesn't fit a perceived \"manual.\" Would you be open to exploring this feeling of being a \"glitch\" with a therapist who can help you unpack this experience with more support?",
      "source": "target",
